_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1027406003:1":{"text":"まあ、アタシは物知りだからね。祭壇の本質を見抜いてたからこそ、賭けに出ることもできたってわけさ、ウサ耳の兄ちゃん。","source_cn":"因为我足够渊博，知道祭坛的本质，才敢于冒险，兔耳朵。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D45D26AD14C7CDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1027406004:1":{"text":"ボクを怒らせて話をそらそうたって、そうはいかないぞ！欲深いトレジャーハンターめ！","source_cn":"这次我可不会被你激怒，然后就被带偏话头了，贪婪的宝藏猎人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBA2F3C01C0428079","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1027406005:1":{"text":"お前は明らかにさっき宝石が戻ってきたのを見て、ほっとしただろ？","source_cn":"你明明是直到刚才确认收回了宝石，才终于松了口气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3E1F4958DC0B6CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1027406006:1":{"text":"それまでは、宝石が供物として持って行かれるかもしれないと認識しながらも、そのリスクを甘んじて受け入れていた……","source_cn":"在此之前，你都是明知宝石被作为祭品牺牲掉的可能性，却甘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7115C6279CD4F162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1027406007:1":{"text":"それがなんだってんだ？\n言っただろ？財宝はその貢献度によって分配するって。","source_cn":"所以，这说明什么？\\n我前面也说过了，如果有宝藏，我们...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1FE2C7AB76E9EF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1027406008:1":{"text":"分配どうこうはさておき、少なくともある一つのことが推測できる。","source_cn":"分不分成我不确定，但我至少可以猜出一件事——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E02C2607001DEC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027406009:1":{"text":"お前が最後の財宝から手に入れようとしているものは、この美しく高価な宝石よりも価値があるということだ。","source_cn":"你想从宝藏中得到的东西，价值绝对高于这块美丽而昂贵的宝石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA193BA190A59DF00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1027406009":{"text":"お前が最後の財宝から手に入れようとしているものは、この美しく高価な宝石よりも価値があるということだ。","source_cn":"你想从宝藏中得到的东西，价值绝对高于这块美丽而昂贵的宝石。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA193BA190A59DF00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027406010:1":{"text":"朱に交われば赤くなる、といったところですよ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん。","source_cn":"毕竟近朱者赤嘛，<style=stress><play...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8AC97CC062EC752F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"朱に交われば赤くなる、といったところですよ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん。","female":"朱に交われば赤くなる、といったところですよ、<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さん。","variant_male_record_index":"108040","variant_female_record_index":"108041","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1027406011:1":{"text":"さあ、答えろ！卑しくて不届きなトレジャーハンターめ！\nお前が鹿霊の財宝から手に入れようとしているものは、いったい